data.prompt:
Build a small sprint-planning area from separate, independently selectable Board pieces: concise Must, Should, and Could summary cards; an adjustable capacity control; and visible typed relationships from Must to Should and Could showing that Must constrains them. Keep the summaries outside the control so each can be selected, moved, and connected independently.

Exact OpenPencil target (do not substitute):
